{"id":"osobenno","lemma":"особенно","pos":"adv","rank":437,"glosses":["especially"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c4/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"«Ты устала?» – «Не особенно».","en":"\"Are you tired?\" \"Not really.\"","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Том здесь никому особенно не нравится.","en":"No one here likes Tom much.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"here"},null,null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to like","l":"нравиться"}]},{"text":"Я об этом особенно не думаю.","en":"I didn't think about it much.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"about"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"I don't think so"]]},{"text":"Сегодня утром особенно холодно.","en":"It is especially cold this morning.","words":[{"g":"today"},{"g":"in the morning"},null,{"g":"coldly"}]},{"text":"Сказать особенно нечего.","en":"There's not much to say.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell"},null,{"g":"there is nothing"}]}]}